---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { url } from '../lib/util';
---
<Base title="Make It Home" description="Explore Houston neighborhoods, understand your options, and take your next step at your own pace.">
  <section class="band">
    <div class="wrap mih-hero">
      <div class="mih-intro">
        <p class="kicker">Make It Home &middot; Houston</p>
        <h1>A place that fits. A life that feels like you.</h1>
        <p class="lede">Explore neighborhoods, understand your options, and take your next step at your own pace.</p>
        <a class="btn gold" href="#start">Find your starting point &darr;</a>
      </div>
      <div class="mih-side">
        <p class="kicker light">More than an address</p>
        <p class="mih-side-text">Your morning coffee.<br />Your favorite park.<br />Your kind of neighborhood.</p>
        <div class="mih-icons">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 10h14v4a4 4 0 0 1-4 4H7a4 4 0 0 1-4-4v-4z"/><path d="M17 11h2a2 2 0 0 1 0 4h-2"/><path d="M6 3c0 1-1 1-1 2s1 1 1 2"/><path d="M10 3c0 1-1 1-1 2s1 1 1 2"/></svg>
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 2a5 5 0 0 1 5 5c0 3-5 9-5 9s-5-6-5-9a5 5 0 0 1 5-5z"/><circle cx="12" cy="7" r="2"/></svg>
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 11l9-7 9 7"/><path d="M5 10v9a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h4v-6h4v6h4a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-9"/></svg>
        </div>
        <span class="mih-tag">Discover first. Decide when you're ready.</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" id="start">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="section-head">
        <h2>Where would you like to begin?</h2>
        <span class="muted small">Every chapter has a starting point.</span>
      </div>
      <div class="start-grid">
        <div class="start-card">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="8" r="4"/><path d="M4 21c0-4 3.5-7 8-7s8 3 8 7"/></svg>
          <h3>Find your neighborhood</h3>
          <p>Get to know the places you're considering, side by side.</p>
          <a class="btn outline" href={url('/find-your-fit')}>Compare neighborhoods &rarr;</a>
        </div>
        <div class="start-card">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="8" cy="15" r="4"/><path d="M11 12l8-8"/><path d="M15 8l2 2"/><path d="M18 5l2 2"/></svg>
          <h3>Find your next rental</h3>
          <p>Learn about leases, applications, and what to prepare before you move.</p>
          <a class="mlink" href={url('/neighborhood-info-request')}>Explore renting &rarr;</a>
        </div>
        <div class="start-card">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 11l9-7 9 7"/><path d="M5 10v9a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h4v-6h4v6h4a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-9"/></svg>
          <h3>Explore homeownership</h3>
          <p>Understand the steps, ask questions, and build a plan that works for you.</p>
          <a class="mlink" href={url('/neighborhood-info-request')}>Start learning &rarr;</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section tint">
    <div class="wrap fit-teaser">
      <div class="fit-teaser-copy">
        <p class="kicker light">Find your fit</p>
        <h2>Same city. Different everyday lives.</h2>
        <p>Compare the details that matter to you: housing, daily routes, local places, and costs to check.</p>
        <a class="btn gold" href={url('/find-your-fit')}>Compare neighborhoods &rarr;</a>
      </div>
      <div class="fit-preview-card">
        <div class="fit-preview-head">
          <h3 id="fp-a">The Heights</h3>
          <span class="muted small">versus</span>
        </div>
        <h3 id="fp-b">Spring Branch</h3>
        <ul class="fit-preview-list">
          <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="16" height="16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 11l9-7 9 7"/><path d="M5 10v9a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h4v-6h4v6h4a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-9"/></svg> Housing &amp; home styles</li>
          <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="16" height="16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="7" cy="17" r="2"/><circle cx="17" cy="17" r="2"/><path d="M5 17V7h9l5 5v5"/></svg> Your commute &amp; daily errands</li>
          <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="16" height="16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 10h14v4a4 4 0 0 1-4 4H7a4 4 0 0 1-4-4v-4z"/><path d="M17 11h2a2 2 0 0 1 0 4h-2"/></svg> Food, parks &amp; local discoveries</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="muted small">Compare your priorities. Keep your favorites.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2>Make yourself at home.</h2>
      <div class="home-grid">
        <div class="home-card">
          <h3>Moving to Houston</h3>
          <p>A practical starting point for planning a move and getting oriented.</p>
          <a class="mlink" href={url('/cities')}>Plan your arrival &rarr;</a>
        </div>
        <div class="home-card">
          <h3>Care for your home</h3>
          <p>Explore upkeep, renovations, materials, and outdoor living.</p>
          <a class="mlink" href={url('/home-and-design')}>Explore home resources &rarr;</a>
        </div>
        <div class="home-card">
          <h3>Your home, your next chapter</h3>
          <p>Considering a sale or a change? Start with your goals and questions.</p>
          <a class="mlink" href={url('/neighborhood-info-request')}>Explore your next move &rarr;</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section tint">
    <div class="wrap talk-row">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">A little guidance goes a long way</p>
        <h2>Talk it through with Dillon.</h2>
        <p>Whether you're exploring, renting, buying, or planning ahead, start with a conversation.</p>
      </div>
      <a class="btn gold talk-btn" href={url('/neighborhood-info-request')}>Ask a question
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M21 11.5a8.4 8.4 0 0 1-8.8 8.4 9 9 0 0 1-3.4-.7L4 20l1-4.6A8.3 8.3 0 0 1 4 11.5 8.4 8.4 0 0 1 12.8 3a8.3 8.3 0 0 1 8.2 8.5z"/></svg>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<script>
  const PAIRS = [
    ['The Heights', 'Spring Branch'],
    ['Katy', 'Cypress'],
    ['Sugar Land', 'Pearland'],
    ['Tanglewood', 'Memorial West'],
    ['River Oaks', 'Memorial Villages'],
    ['Bellaire', 'Meyerland'],
    ['Rice / Museum District', 'West University / Southside'],
  ];
  const a = document.getElementById('fp-a');
  const b = document.getElementById('fp-b');
  if (a && b) {
    let i = 0;
    setInterval(() => {
      i = (i + 1) % PAIRS.length;
      [a, b].forEach((el) => { el.classList.add('fade'); });
      setTimeout(() => {
        a.textContent = PAIRS[i][0];
        b.textContent = PAIRS[i][1];
        [a, b].forEach((el) => { el.classList.remove('fade'); });
      }, 250);
    }, 3500);
  }
</script>
<style>
  .kicker { color: var(--gold); font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .04em; font-size: 12px; margin: 0 0 12px; }
  .kicker.light { color: rgba(255,255,255,.75); }
  .lede { max-width: 48ch; }
  .crumb { font-size: 13px; color: var(--muted); }

  .mih-hero { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.3fr 1fr; gap: 24px; align-items: stretch; }
  .mih-intro { display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; }
  .mih-side { background: rgba(255,255,255,.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 28px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px; }
  .mih-side-text { font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 1.4rem; line-height: 1.3; margin: 0; color: #fff; }
  .mih-icons { display: flex; gap: 14px; color: rgba(255,255,255,.7); }
  .mih-tag { background: rgba(0,0,0,.25); border-radius: 999px; padding: 8px 16px; font-size: 13px; width: fit-content; }

  .section-head { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; gap: 16px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-bottom: 4px; border: none; padding: 0; }
  .start-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 20px; margin-top: 24px; }
  .start-card { background: var(--cream); border-radius: 10px; padding: 24px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; }
  .start-card svg { color: var(--navy); }
  .start-card h3 { margin: 0; font-size: 1.2rem; }
  .start-card p { margin: 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: 14px; flex: 1; }
  .start-card .btn, .start-card .mlink { align-self: flex-start; margin-top: 6px; }
  .mlink { color: var(--blue); font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none; }

  .fit-teaser { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 40px; align-items: center; }
  .fit-preview-card { background: rgba(32,69,94,.06); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 12px; padding: 24px; }
  .fit-preview-head { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; }
  .fit-preview-card h3 { margin: 0 0 4px; font-size: 1.3rem; transition: opacity .25s ease; }
  .fit-preview-card h3.fade { opacity: 0; }
  .fit-preview-list { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 16px 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; }
  .fit-preview-list li { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--navy); }

  .home-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 20px; margin-top: 24px; }
  .home-card { background: var(--cream); border-radius: 10px; padding: 24px; }
  .home-card h3 { margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: 1.2rem; }
  .home-card p { margin: 0 0 12px; color: var(--muted); font-size: 14px; }

  .talk-row { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 24px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .talk-row p.eyebrow { color: #1e7a43; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .04em; text-transform: uppercase; margin: 0 0 8px; }
  .talk-row p:last-child { color: var(--muted); max-width: 46ch; margin: 8px 0 0; }
  .talk-btn { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; }

  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .mih-hero, .start-grid, .fit-teaser, .home-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }
</style>
